---
description: Absolute import aliases for hand-written Portal app code
globs: "{pages,layouts,composables,services,stores,models,validations,components/molecules,components/organisms}/**/*.{vue,ts}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Import Alias

- Local imports: `@/`, `~/`, `#...`, or package aliases such as `#scripts/*`.
- Do not apply to `components/ui/`, `.nuxt/`, `stories/auto/`, or shadcn-generated files.
- No new relative imports `../foo` or `./foo` in hand-written app code.
